{"productId": "d075469f-1216-4ab3-b085-9b6aa33b5819", "modelName": "Scorpion EVO 3 S1", "modelDescription": "Available in two variants, the Scorpion Carbine is a whole new animal. Building on the lauded submachinegun platform that first hit the US civilian market in pistol form in 2015, the Carbine has a 16.2\" barrel fitted with either a compensating muzzle brake or a faux suppressor built specifically for CZ-USA by SilencerCo. Fit with the factory's folding adjustable stock, the Carbine features a number of US-made parts to make it fully 922(r) compliant. One of the nicest features of the firearm is the newly-designed forend, covered in M-LOK attachment points to keep the profile slim while still being big enough to swallow most pistol-caliber suppressors should the owner decide down the road to convert it into an SBR for use with a suppressor.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "832125d8-b2df-4850-b955-ef8ec8ea6cd7", "description": "CZ, Scorpion, EVO 3 S1, Semi Automatic, 22 Long Rifle, 16\" Threaded Barrel, Matte Black Finish, Adjustable Sights, Folding Adjustable Stock, M-LOK Handguard, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/98f54a61-7c4a-406c-b024-0eade409171c"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "91368", "upc": "806703913681", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "db37bebf-6c74-4ab8-a6f3-fd9371d1d357", "valueName": "Adjustable"}, {"attributeNameId": "1937a917-3f18-422b-bdf3-d388ad679bac", "attributeName": "Muzzle Device", "attributeValueId": "5e960eff-58cb-40ec-b705-ae5cfd28d5d1", "valueName": "Muzzle Brake / Compensator"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "27d45ae9-aff1-4ebc-88aa-1481c3e44c20", "valueName": "16\""}, {"attributeNameId": "71e51227-d